<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Reset your QualtSpire password</title></head>
  <body style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#111827;line-height:1.6">
    <h1>Reset your password</h1>
    <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
    <p>Enter this code in QualtSpire to verify your email and choose a new password:</p>
    <p style="font-size:32px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:6px"><%= otp %></p>
    <p>This code expires in <%= expiresInMinutes %> minutes and can only be used once.</p>
    <p>If you did not request a password reset, ignore this email. Your password has not changed.</p>
    <p>Do not share this code with anyone.</p>
  </body>
</html>
